      <p style="margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--ink);"><strong>Conclusion:</strong> Libra Sun in the 7th House, Pisces Ascendant, and social Four made him a highly sensitive seismograph. The Aquarius Moon and Scorpio Mercury in the 8th House provided the intellectual and provocative equipment – while the Sagittarius MC always directed his gaze toward the horizon of a peaceful utopia.</p>
