        <p style="font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.75;color:var(--anthracite);margin:0;"><strong>Personal Transformation:</strong> In combination with Enneagram work, the frequencies can help address specific emotional and mental challenges. The Solfeggio frequencies offer a powerful way to bring body, mind, and soul into harmony &mdash; and can be used specifically regarding the Enneagram types to dissolve emotional, mental, and spiritual blockages.</p>
